- **Sustainable Content Production**: Beyond streaming, platforms are adopting sustainable practices in content production. For example, major studios now prioritize eco-friendly set designs and reduce waste during filming. This shift reflects a growing trend toward sustainability in the entertainment industry, resonating with audiences who value corporate responsibility.

